Feeziq Privacy Policy
Effective Date: June 2, 2025

Welcome to Feeziq! This Privacy Policy explains how Feeziq collects, uses, and shares your information when you use our mobile application. By accessing or using Feeziq, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy. If you do not agree with the terms of this policy, please do not use our app.

1. Introduction
Feeziq is designed for users aged 8 and older. If you are under 18 years old, you must have your parent or guardian's permission to use Feeziq.

2. Information We Collect
We collect various types of information to provide and improve our service to you:

Personal Information You Provide: This includes information you voluntarily give us when you set up your profile or interact with the app, such as your name, email address, and any other profile details you choose to add.
Usage Data: We automatically collect information about how you access and use Feeziq. This may include your interactions with other users, the content you post, and details about your device (e.g., device type, operating system).
Health and Activity Data: To accurately calculate burned calories and provide relevant fitness insights, we collect personal data related to your physical activity and potentially other health metrics you choose to input or allow us to access.
3. How We Use Your Information
We use the information we collect for various purposes, including:

Providing and Improving Feeziq: To operate, maintain, and enhance the features and functionality of our app.
Personalizing Your Experience: To tailor content and features to your preferences and usage patterns.
Communication: To send you important updates, notifications, and respond to your inquiries.
Analytics: To understand how users interact with Feeziq, which helps us improve the app.
Calorie Calculation: To provide accurate burned calorie calculations based on your activity data.
4. How We Share Your Information
We value your privacy. We do not share your personal information with any third party without your explicit consent, except in the following limited circumstances:

Legal Requirements: If required to do so by law or in response to valid requests by public authorities (e.g., a court order or government agency).
Protection of Rights: To protect the rights, property, or safety of Feeziq, our users, or others.
Service Providers: We may share information with trusted third-party service providers who assist us in operating our app, conducting our business, or serving our users, as long as those parties agree to keep this information confidential.
5. Third-Party Services
Feeziq may use third-party services (e.g., analytics providers) that may collect information used to identify you. We encourage you to review the privacy policies of these third-party services directly.

6. Data Security
We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information from unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, please be aware that no method of transmission over the internet or method of electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your personal information, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.

7. Children's Privacy
Feeziq is designed for users aged 8 and older. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 8 years of age. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us with personal information without your consent, please contact us, and we will take steps to remove that information and terminate the child's account.

8. Your Consent
By using Feeziq, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its terms.

9. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page within the app. You are advised to review this Privacy Policy periodically for any changes. Changes to this Privacy Policy are effective when they are posted on this page.
